// DRAFT (Act III, planning only). Ch18 K02 "The chart table" (E, 1.5 min). act3_ch18.md §2 K02.
// Dace's charts (Corrow circled), Ysolde's keth notes, Liss's engine log: the world map opens (SPEC §6.6).
// Ysolde's line pays Ch17 B11 and sends them to Reedhollow (the critical path's one road).
title: ch18_the_chart_table
location: ch18/kite
---
@camera K04
@mark ysolde chart_table walk
@anim ysolde lay_out keth_notes
@wait 2.0
Ysolde [neutral]: I have the words. Pell has the tune. We go to Reedhollow. #line:ch18_chart_001
@anim pell look_at chart_table
@wait 2.0
Pell [neutral]: They will not let me in. #line:ch18_chart_002
Asha [tender]: Then we'll ask again. #line:ch18_chart_003
<<set $ch18_world_open = true>>
===
